-</nav></header><div class="panel" hidden id="pl"></div><div class="panel a11yp" hidden id="a11y"><h2>Accessible reading</h2><div class="ctrls"><div class="grp"><span>Text size</span><button data-a="fs-">A−</button><button data-a="fs+">A+</button></div><button data-a="ls">Wider letter spacing</button><button data-a="big">Bigger buttons</button><button data-a="hc">More contrast</button><button data-a="guide">Reading guide</button><button data-a="tts">Read aloud</button><button data-a="rm">Reduce motion</button><button class="reset" data-a="reset">Reset</button></div></div><button class="exit-focus stopq" id="exitFocus" type="button">Exit clean screen</button><main id="main" class="igx"><section class="xhero glass"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a></p><h1>Quiet space</h1><p class="lede">Choose an image, a sound or a pause. Nothing moves or plays until you decide.</p></section><div class="r40-mode-nav" hidden><div class="r40-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Quiet space tools"><button id="r40-tab-videos" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="watch" data-r40-mode="videos">Videos</button><button id="r40-tab-sounds" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="listen" data-r40-mode="sounds" tabindex="-1">Sounds</button><button id="r40-tab-ball" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pause" data-r40-mode="ball" tabindex="-1">Relaxation ball</button></div><label class="r40-mobile-mode" for="r40ModeSelect">Choose a tool<select id="r40ModeSelect"><option value="videos">Videos</option><option value="sounds">Sounds</option><option value="ball">Relaxation ball</option></select></label></div><div class="qgrid r40-workspace" id="r40Workspace"><details class="qcard glass" id="watch"><summary><h2>Watch</h2></summary><p>Real nature footage and sensory spaces. Nothing starts until you decide.</p><div class="qscenes" id="sceneList"><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="sea"><span class="qthumb qthumb-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Sea</strong><small>Waves reaching the shore</small></span></button><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="rain"><span class="qthumb qthumb-rain" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Rain on the window</strong><small>Drops sliding down the glass</small></span></button><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="river"><span class="qthumb qthumb-river" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Stream in the forest</strong><small>Water, stones and falling leaves</small></span></button><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="night"><span class="qthumb qthumb-night" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Night sky</strong><small>Stars and an aurora over a lake</small></span></button><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="aquarium"><span class="qthumb qthumb-aq" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Aquarium</strong><small>Fish, plants and bubbles</small></span></button><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="bubbles"><span class="qthumb qthumb-bu" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Bubble tube</strong><small>Like in a sensory room</small></span></button><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="jellies"><span class="qthumb qthumb-je" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Jellyfish</strong><small>Glowing jellyfish that pulse slowly</small></span></button><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="fibre"><span class="qthumb qthumb-fi" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Fibre optics</strong><small>Strands of light from a sensory room</small></span></button><button type="button" class="qchoice" data-scene="octopus"><span class="qthumb qthumb-octopus" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Octopuses</strong><small>Octopuses among rocks and plants underwater</small></span></button><div class="qopts qscene-opts"><fieldset><legend>Light</legend><label class="qhint qvol" for="sceneBright">Brightness</label><input type="range" id="sceneBright" class="qrange" min="30" max="100" value="100"><div class="qseg"><label><input type="checkbox" id="sceneWarm"> Warmer light</label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Turn off by itself</legend><label class="qhint qvol" for="sceneOff">When</label><select id="sceneOff" class="qselect"><option value="0">No</option><option value="10">In 10 minutes</option><option value="20">In 20 minutes</option><option value="30">In 30 minutes</option></select><p class="qhint">At the end, the picture and the sound fade out slowly over one minute.</p></fieldset><fieldset class="r40-audio-settings"><legend>Scene sound</legend><input type="checkbox" id="sceneSound" hidden aria-hidden="true"><label class="qhint qvol" for="sceneVol">Volume</label><input type="range" id="sceneVol" class="qrange" min="0" max="100" value="30"><p class="qhint">The sound is made on your device and starts quietly. You can mute it or use the image only.</p></fieldset></div></div><div class="stage" id="watchStage"><div class="empty-stage">Choose a scene whenever you want.</div></div><p class="credit" id="watchCredit"></p><p class="qhint" id="sceneTouchHint" hidden>You can also tap or click the picture.</p><p class="qhint r40-scene-status" id="r40SceneStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose a scene. It will not start until you press Watch and listen or Image only.</p><div class="qbuttons r40-scene-actions"><button type="button" class="primaryq" id="r40StartAV">Watch and listen</button><button type="button" id="r40ImageOnly">Image only</button><button type="button" id="r40Mute" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Mute</button><button type="button" id="sceneTouch" aria-label="Activate scene" hidden></button><button id="stopVideo">Stop</button><button type="button" id="sceneFull">View full screen</button><button data-focus="watch">Clean screen</button></div></details><details class="qcard glass" id="listen"><summary><h2>Listen</h2></summary><p>Sounds made in Iris Green. Choose one whenever you want. None of them starts by itself.</p><div id="soundFinder" class="qsound-search" hidden><label for="soundQuery">Find a sound or music</label><input id="soundQuery" type="search" autocomplete="off"><div class="qbuttons"><button type="button" data-sound-filter="">All sounds</button><button type="button" data-sound-filter="Music">Music</button></div><p id="soundResults" role="status"></p></div><details class="agrupo qmix qgenbox" id="genSounds" open hidden><summary><span>Made by Iris Green</span><small>12 sounds</small></summary><p class="qhint qmix-intro">Sounds created by Iris Green. They are not recordings. They start quietly and keep playing until you stop them.</p><div id="genList"></div><div class="qgenvol"><label class="qhint" for="genVol">Volume</label><input type="range" id="genVol" class="qrange" min="0" max="100" value="50"></div><p class="qhint qmix-intro">Quiet is best: about the volume of a calm conversation.</p><div class="qgenvol"><label class="qhint" for="listenOff">Turn off by itself</label><select id="listenOff" class="qselect"><option value="0">No</option><option value="10">In 10 minutes</option><option value="20">In 20 minutes</option><option value="30">In 30 minutes</option><option value="60">In 1 hour</option></select></div></details><div class="audio-list" id="audioList" hidden aria-hidden="true"></div><details class="agrupo qmix" id="mixer"><summary><span>Mix sounds</span><small>several at once</small></summary><p class="qhint qmix-intro">Turn on the ones you want and set each volume. They start quietly and repeat without gaps.</p><div id="mixList"></div><div class="qbuttons"><button type="button" id="mixStop">Stop the mix</button></div></details><div class="audio-now"><strong id="audioTitle">Choose a sound</strong><audio id="audio" controls preload="none" hidden aria-hidden="true"></audio><div class="credit" id="audioCredit">Sound created by Iris Green · not a recording</div></div><div class="qbuttons"><button id="stopAudio">Stop sound</button><button data-focus="listen">Clean screen</button></div></details><details class="qcard glass" id="pause"><summary><h2>Guided pause</h2></summary><p>A quiet visual guide. Follow it if you want, or simply watch.</p><div class="qopts"><fieldset><legend>How</legend><div class="qseg"><label><input type="radio" name="pmode" value="look" checked> Watch the shape</label><label><input type="radio" name="pmode" value="breathe"> Breathe with the shape</label></div></fieldset><p class="qhint">With “Watch the shape” you do not have to do anything else. Breathing is optional.</p><fieldset><legend>Rhythm</legend><div class="qseg"><label><input type="radio" name="pritmo" value="46" checked> 4 s grows, 6 s shrinks</label><label><input type="radio" name="pritmo" value="66"> 6 s and 6 s, slower</label></div></fieldset><label class="qhint" id="pvibRow" hidden><input type="checkbox" id="pvib"> Gentle vibration at each change (only on phones that allow it)</label><label class="qhint" for="pdur">How long</label><select id="pdur" class="qselect"><option value="0">No end</option><option value="0.5">30 seconds</option><option value="1">1 minute</option><option value="3">3 minutes</option><option value="5">5 minutes</option></select></div><div class="breathbox" id="breathBox"><div><div class="orbwrap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ring r1"></span><span class="ring r2"></span><span class="ring r3"></span><div class="orb" id="orb"><span class="core"></span></div></div><div class="breath-label" id="breathLabel">Ready whenever you are.</div></div></div><div class="qbuttons"><button class="primaryq" id="startBreath">Start</button><button id="stopBreath">Stop</button><button data-focus="pause">Clean screen</button></div></details></div></main><footer class="ft"><p><strong>Iris Green</strong> · A knowledge base on neurodiversity</p><nav aria-label="Explore" class="ftnav"><a href="/es/sobre-iris-green/">About Iris Green</a><a href="/es/lectura-accesible/">Accessibility</a><a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy</a></nav></footer><div hidden id="rguide"></div><script src="../../assets/lectura-accesible.js"></script><script>(function(){const ES=false,$=s=>document.querySelector(s);const stopV=$('#stopVideo'),stage=$('#watchStage'),credit=$('#watchCredit');if(stopV)stopV.onclick=()=>{if(stage)stage.innerHTML='<div class="empty-stage">Choose a scene whenever you want.</div>';if(credit)credit.textContent=''};const stopA=$('#stopAudio');if(stopA)stopA.onclick=()=>{const a=$('#audio');if(a){a.pause();a.currentTime=0}};let running=false,timer=null,phase=false;function tick(){if(!running)return;phase=!phase;$('#breathBox').classList.toggle('breathing',phase);$('#breathLabel').textContent=phase?'Breathe in slowly':'Breathe out slowly';timer=setTimeout(tick,phase?((window.IGRitmo||[4000,6000])[0]):((window.IGRitmo||[4000,6000])[1]))}$('#startBreath').onclick=()=>{running=false;clearTimeout(timer);$('#breathBox').classList.remove('breathing');running=true;phase=false;$('#breathBox').classList.add('ig-guiding');tick()};$('#stopBreath').onclick=()=>{$('#breathBox').classList.remove('ig-guiding');running=false;clearTimeout(timer);$('#breathBox').classList.remove('breathing');$('#breathLabel').textContent='Ready whenever you are.'};document.querySelectorAll('[data-focus]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.qcard').forEach(c=>c.classList.toggle('focus-keep',c.id===b.dataset.focus));document.body.classList.add('focus-mode');window.scrollTo(0,0)});$('#exitFocus').onclick=()=>{document.body.classList.remove('focus-mode');document.querySelectorAll('.qcard').forEach(c=>c.classList.remove('focus-keep'))};window.addEventListener('pagehide',()=>{running=false;clearTimeout(timer)})})();</script><script defer src="/assets/interfaz-comun.js"></script>
