egend>Place</legend><div class="r46-choices"><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="playa" aria-pressed="true"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#2a6079"></span><span><strong>Beach</strong><small>A single shore, fixed camera</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="rio" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#2f5b41"></span><span><strong>River</strong><small>Forest stream, fixed shot</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="lluvia" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#33475c"></span><span><strong>Rain</strong><small>Rain on glass, no storm</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="noche" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#1e2b4d"></span><span><strong>Night</strong><small>Very slow night sky</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="acuario" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#1f5a6b"></span><span><strong>Aquarium</strong><small>A single tank, still camera</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="medusas" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#3d2a5e"></span><span><strong>Jellyfish</strong><small>Slow drift underwater</small></span></button></div><p class="r46-hint">Long programmes of a single place. Nothing starts until you press.</p></fieldset><fieldset class="r46-group"><legend>Session</legend><label class="r46-hint" for="r46LandDuration">How long</label><select class="r46-select" id="r46LandDuration"><option value="0">Continuous</option><option value="600">10 minutes</option><option value="1200">20 minutes</option><option value="1800">30 minutes</option><option value="3600">60 minutes</option></selec