úsica"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 18V6l11-2v12"></path><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle><circle cx="17" cy="16" r="3"></circle></svg><span>Música</span></button></div><nav aria-label="Idioma" class="langs"><span aria-current="true" class="lang on">ES</span><a class="lang" href="/en/quiet-space/" lang="en">EN</a></nav></header><div class="panel" hidden id="pl"></div><div class="panel a11yp" hidden id="a11y"><h2>Lectura accesible</h2><div class="ctrls"><div class="grp"><span>Tamaño del texto</span><button data-a="fs-">A−</button><button data-a="fs+">A+</button></div><button data-a="ls">Letra más separada</button><button data-a="big">Botones más grandes</button><button data-a="hc">Más contraste</button><button data-a="guide">Guía de lectura</button><button data-a="tts">Leer en voz alta</button><button data-a="rm">Reducir movimiento</button><button class="reset" data-a="reset">Restablecer</button></div></div><button class="exit-focus stopq" id="exitFocus" type="button">Salir de pantalla limpia</button><main id="main" class="igx r46"><section class="xhero"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">Inicio</a></p><h1>Rincón tranquilo</h1><p class="lede">Elige una forma de estar aquí. Nada empieza hasta que tú lo decidas.</p></section><div class="r40-mode-nav"><div class="r40-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Formas de estar aquí"><button id="r46-tab-breathe" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="r46Breathe" data-r46-mode="breathe">Respirar</button><button id="r46-tab-land" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="r46Landscapes" data-r46-mode="land" tabindex="-1">Paisajes</button><button id="r46-tab-room" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="r46Rooms" data-r46-mode="room" tabindex="-1">Salas inmersivas</button></div><label class="r40-mobile-mode" for="r46ModeSelect">Elige una forma<select id="r46ModeSelect"><option value="breathe">Respirar</option><option value="land">Paisajes</option><option value="room">Salas inmersivas</option></select></label></div><div id="r40Workspace" class="r46-panels"><section class="r46-panel" id="r46Breathe" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="r46-tab-breathe"><div class="r46-workspace"><div class="r46-stage ig-sobre-oscuro" id="r46BreatheStage"><p class="r46-stage-note">Mira la bola o respira con ella si te resulta cómodo.</p></div><div class="r46-rail"><fieldset class="r46-group"><legend>Cómo</legend><div class="r46-seg"><label><input type="radio" name="r46-pattern" value="watch" checked> Solo mirar</label><label><input type="radio" name="r46-pattern" value="4-6"> 4 dentro, 6 fuera</label><label><input type="radio" name="r46-pattern" value="6-6"> 6 dentro, 6 fuera</label></div><p class="r46-hint">Con «Solo mirar» no tienes que hacer nada más. Respirar es opcional.</p></fieldset><fieldset class="r46-group"><legend>Cuánto rato</legend><label class="r46-hint" for="r46BreathDuration">Duración</label><select class="r46-select" id="r46BreathDuration"><option value="0">Sin final</option><option value="60">1 minuto</option><option value="180">3 minutos</option><option value="300">5 minutos</option></select><label class="r46-hint" for="r46BreathLevel">Intensidad</label><select class="r46-select" id="r46BreathLevel"><option value="suave">Suave</option><option value="normal">Normal</option></select><label class="r46-hint" for="r46BreathMotion">Movimiento</label><select class="r46-select" id="r46BreathMotion"><option value="normal">Normal</option><option value="reducido">Reducido</option><option value="quieto">Sin movimiento</option></select><p class="r46-hint" id="r46BreathMotionNote"></p><p class="r46-hint" id="r46BreathEngine"></p></fieldset><div class="r46-actions"><button type="button" class="r46-primary" id="r46BreathStart">Empezar</button><button type="button" id="r46BreathPause" hidden>Pausar</button><button type="button" id="r46BreathResume" hidden>Reanudar</button><button type="button" id="r46BreathStop" disabled>Parar</button><button type="button" data-r46-clean>Pantalla limpia</button></div><p class="r46-status" id="r46BreatheStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div></section><section class="r46-panel" id="r46Landscapes" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="r46-tab-land" hidden><div class="r46-workspace"><div class="r46-stage ig-sobre-oscuro" id="r46LandStage"></div><div class="r46-rail"><fieldset class="r46-group"><legend>Sitio</legend><div class="r46-choices"><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="playa" aria-pressed="true"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#2a6079"></span><span><strong>Playa</strong><small>Una sola orilla, cámara fija</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="rio" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#2f5b41"></span><span><strong>Río</strong><small>Corriente de bosque, plano fijo</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="lluvia" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#33475c"></span><span><strong>Lluvia</strong><small>Lluvia sobre cristal, sin tormenta</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="noche" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#1e2b4d"></span><span><strong>Noche</strong><small>Cielo nocturno muy lento</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="acuario" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#1f5a6b"></span><span><strong>Acuario</strong><small>Un solo acuario, cámara quieta</small></span></button><button type="button" class="r46-choice" data-r46-scene="medusas" aria-pressed="false"><span class="r46-swatch" aria-hidden="true" style="background:#3d2a5e"></span><span><strong>Medusas</strong><small>Desplazamiento lento bajo el agua</small></span></button></div><p class="r46-h